    "title": "Never Have I Ever: Dirty Party",
    "description": "The funniest and hottest version of \"Never Have I Ever\" with over 3,000 unique cards right in your phone.\r\n\r\nSpice up the party and learn a lot about your friends! Party games have never been so exciting and fun.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n+ Gather your friends\r\n+ Loudly read the question on the card\r\n+ Those who do what the card says do the task or punishment\r\n\r\nWHAT'S IN THE GAME:\r\n+ 12 decks and 3000+ unique cards\r\n+ Optional punishments\r\n+ Add your own cards and tasks\r\n+ Hours of fun with your buddies\r\n\r\nIf you've played other party games like Truth or Dare, Most Likely to, 5 second rule, Party Roulette - you'll love this game.",
